OL,3,GNEWSAWomen's concerns about asylum not 
OL,4,Aracist, says think tank                
OL,6,FThe government has been accused of a   
OL,7,F"dereliction of its duty to protect    
OL,8,Fcitizens" by allowing a planned asylum 
OL,9,Fcentre.                                
OL,11,FThe shadow minister for women and      
OL,12,Fequalities, Joy Morrisey, said Labour  
OL,13,Fhad ignored warnings raised by         
OL,14,Fresidents when it granted permission   
OL,15,Ffor the redevelopment of part of MoD   
OL,16,FBicester in Oxfordshire.               
OL,18,FShe was speaking at the launch of a    
OL,19,Freport by the Women's Policy Centre    
OL,20,Fcalled Mass Immigration is a Women's   
OL,21,FIssue, attended by women from          
OL,22,FPiddington, a village near the site.   
