OL,3,GNEWSAWomen's concerns about asylum not 
OL,4,Aracist, says think tank                
OL,6,FThe Home Office said other large sites 
OL,7,Fhad been operating for a number of     
OL,8,Fyears with no rising crime. The Refugee
OL,9,FCouncil said "there is no evidence     
OL,10,Frefugees commit crimes...more than any 
OL,11,Fother groups".                         
